director/guidance.md adapts text from the Qwen video-editing skill documents
(art-direction.md, pacing-rhythm.md, audio-first-cutting.md, scene-review.md, final-review.md),
Copyright the Qwen authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Modifications: condensed, reworded for vertical documentary shorts,
rules requiring minimum numbers of effects or transitions removed, channel profile rules take precedence.
The planning ladder (script -> scene -> shot -> camera) follows the structure of showlab/MovieAgent; no code or model
is included.

director/guidance.md and the storyboard and review checks in director/__init__.py adapt working principles of the
stageshow skill (https://github.com/benjitaylor/skills), Copyright (c) 2026 Benji Taylor, licensed under the MIT
License. Modifications: the ideas (plan the focal thing, its cause, the payoff and what is left out before building;
restraint in on-screen words and numbers; a cause for every motion and a payoff that holds; a fresh-eye review from
frames, ranked framing first) are adapted and reworded for a narrated documentary video of maps, footage and stills.
No code is included.
